1
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 13=

3
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,720
Hold it steady, honey.

4
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:30,200
Remember how you cut my body back then?

5
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:33,640
Now I'll pay you back.

6
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,960
Every time I fell before you,

7
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,200
you always stayed far away.

8
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,480
Finish this dance with me.

9
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,560
Remember,

10
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:58,200
this dance is tailor-made for you.

11
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:38,280
Gu Xiaotang,
I've done everything you asked.

12
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,320
Can you let me go now?

13
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,080
You're wrong.

14
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,160
It's you who won't let yourself go.

15
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:45,720
Not me.

16
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:48,000
You...

17
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:52,680
What do you mean?

18
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,000
Lu Qingyuan, look carefully.

19
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,880
These are all evidence
of your tax evasion,

20
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,560
embezzlement,

21
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:07,640
and forging medical records
to frame Xiaotang.

22
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,360
You used me,

23
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,920
deceived me,

24
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:12,160
and took me for a fool.

25
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:15,800
I think Director Li
has gone to you, right?

26
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:17,640
No.

27
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,960
He didn't go on a business trip.

28
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:22,440
The last time he showed up was
when he came to you with a recording.

29
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,880
That recording reveals

30
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,200
you'd kill for wealth,

31
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,680
even commit matricide.

32
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:30,080
Your reputation will be utterly ruined.

33
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:36,160
I should have guessed
it was you who recorded it.

34
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:40,440
Yes, I recorded it.

35
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:43,040
But you said those ruthless words

36
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,680
yourself.

37
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,240
By now,

38
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,040
the police should have
searched your study.

39
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,120
(Lu Qingyuan,)

40
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,320
(the image you painstakingly built)

41
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,680
(and the dignity you treasured)

42
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:04,000
(have all been destroyed by yourself.)

43
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:08,120
This is your end.

44
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:13,880
You wretch!

45
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:21,520
It's over.

46
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,240
It's all over.

47
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,640
This time we can finally
break the loop, right?

48
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,720
Ye Shen, thank you.

49
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,760
Without you,

50
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:35,200
I'd still be trapped
in that desperate loop,

51
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:40,000
going through the humiliation

52
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,080
and betrayal again and again.

53
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:45,120
You are tough enough to break the loop.

54
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,000
I just happen to be here.

55
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:50,200
No, not at all.

56
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,880
To be honest,

57
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,960
you've been helping me
from start to finish.

58
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,680
But I haven't done anything for you.

59
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:59,160
Do you have any unfulfilled dreams,

60
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,400
or

61
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,400
any regrets?

62
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,200
Tell me, I'll help you.

63
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,480
I...

64
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,360
I have no regrets.

65
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,360
Yes, you do.

66
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,360
Tell me.

67
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,760
Otherwise, I'd feel bad.

68
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:27,680
My regret was in my high school days.

69
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:31,080
There were some things
that I didn't get to say

70
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,360
or get to do in time.

71
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,400
Thinking back now,

72
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,720
it's all too late.

73
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,680
High school?

74
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,960
Then what exactly was it?

75
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,760
Tell me.

76
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,000
It's fine, it's all in the past.

77
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:55,200
Xiaotang, tell me.

78
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,680
Is this

79
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,120
the perfect ending you want?

80
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,720
Perfect?

81
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,960
Maybe.

82
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,760
This ending

83
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,960
is the best ending
I can achieve at the moment.

84
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,320
But Ye Shen,

85
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,320
if I could go back
to my high school days,

86
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:21,880
I'd want to go back.

87
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,200
Back then, I had

88
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,040
a wicked stepfather.

89
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,480
(I deeply regret)

90
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:40,360
(that I didn't have enough strength
to protect my mom,)

91
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,720
(and I didn't firmly make her
leave that man.)

92
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,800
(If I had been tougher,)

93
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,760
(my mom wouldn't have
fallen ill from depression)

94
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,080
(and left me so early.)

95
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,880
(I also deeply regret)

96
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,640
(that I didn't take my mom's advice.)

97
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,160
(I was obsessed with becoming a star,)

98
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,280
(chasing my star dream.)

99
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,160
(Party B's Signature)

100
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:59,240
(I dropped out of school
and signed that contract.)

101
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,440
One mistake led to many,

102
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,800
and that's why I'm stuck

103
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,920
with these nightmares.

104
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:10,960
So, if I could go back
to my high school days,

105
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,840
I'd want to change all of this.

106
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,640
But Ye Shen, don't worry.

107
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:21,200
I'll definitely help you
make up for your regrets too.

108
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,280
Even though you don't tell me now,

109
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,160
I'll find out eventually.

110
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,480
Gu Xiaotang.

111
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:31,880
Gu Xiaotang.

112
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:34,680
You ruined my son.

113
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,440
You ruined the Lu family.

114
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,000
You'll die a horrible death.

115
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,200
Is it my fault?

116
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:43,360
You deserve all of this.

117
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:44,760
Nonsense!

118
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,840
It's all your fault.

119
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,600
Since you ruined us,

120
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,080
then I will make you pay!

121
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,840
Mrs. Lu, calm down.

122
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,080
It's all over.

123
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,080
Die!

124
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,440
Ye Shen.

125
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,280
Ye Shen.

126
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,640
Are you okay?

127
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,480
Retribution. This is retribution.

128
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,080
Gu Xiaotang,

129
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:24,480
how does it feel to watch
someone important to you die?

130
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,080
Since you ruined me,

131
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,040
then I will make you suffer!

132
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:34,040
It's okay, Ye Shen.

133
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,240
This ending isn't perfect enough.

134
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,920
Let's do it all over again.

135
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,360
What are you doing?

136
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,640
Stay back.

137
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,160
Do you want to die with him?

138
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,600
You're insane!

139
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:15,280
(Ye Shen, we'll meet again soon.)

140
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:25,520
(Ye Shen, no matter how many loops
I have to go through,)

141
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:28,120
(we will definitely
get the perfect ending.)

142
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,440
I...

143
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,280
(Gu Xiaotang's High School Days)

144
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,280
I...

145
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,000
I'm back?

146
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,080
I understand now.

147
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:57,040
Even if I survived the wedding,

148
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,040
eradicated the Lu family

149
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,200
and all those villains,

150
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,880
the cause and effect
were already settled long ago.

151
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,120
As long as villains exist,

152
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:07,040
those I care about and I
will never be safe.

153
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:12,560
The loop isn't about
winning on the wedding day,

154
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:15,600
but going back
to the start of all the tragedies.

155
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,280
Alright.

156
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,400
This time, I must win.

157
00:10:56,424 --> 00:10:59,780
♪The face deep in the heart♪

158
00:10:59,972 --> 00:11:02,434
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

159
00:11:03,809 --> 00:11:07,509
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

160
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:10,160
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

161
00:11:10,307 --> 00:11:12,679
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

162
00:11:12,829 --> 00:11:15,586
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

163
00:11:15,586 --> 00:11:17,907
♪Even for just a second♪

164
00:11:19,252 --> 00:11:22,715
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

165
00:11:22,843 --> 00:11:24,692
♪And sunlight reverses♪

166
00:11:24,692 --> 00:11:28,162
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

167
00:11:28,518 --> 00:11:30,592
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

168
00:11:31,094 --> 00:11:34,503
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

169
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:39,972
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

170
00:11:41,226 --> 00:11:43,791
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

171
00:11:43,833 --> 00:11:47,286
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

172
00:11:47,863 --> 00:11:50,826
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

173
00:11:51,571 --> 00:11:54,179
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

174
00:11:54,179 --> 00:11:57,802
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

175
00:11:58,272 --> 00:12:02,328
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
